### 30. Availability (Tuesday, normal day) -> 200, 15 slots
GET http://localhost:3002/stylists/{{createStylist.response.body.id}}/availability?date=2026-12-01&serviceId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 31. Availability (Wednesday, stylist is off) -> 200, slots empty
GET http://localhost:3002/stylists/{{createStylist.response.body.id}}/availability?date=2026-12-02&serviceId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 32. Availability (Sunday, no working hours) -> 200, slots empty
GET http://localhost:3002/stylists/{{createStylist.response.body.id}}/availability?date=2026-12-06&serviceId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

