Authorization: Bearer {{ownerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 36. Availability (service does not exist) -> 404
GET http://localhost:3002/stylists/{{createStylist.response.body.id}}/availability?date=2026-12-01&serviceId=9999
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 37. Review (customer, appointment 100, rating 5) -> 201
